<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Space-Control: Process-Level Isolation for Sharing CXL-based Disaggregated Memory</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>; ; </span></span></span>
