<th id="S6.T2.2.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">Peak remote memory bandwidth</th>
<td id="S6.T2.2.1.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">76.8 GiB/s</td></tr>
